    "<b>设置页</b>：点顶栏右上角的齿轮打开（<code>Esc</code> 或「完成」关闭）。里面分 外观 / 语言 / 编辑器 三节：\n          <b>主题</b>（亮色 / 暗色）、<b>界面语言</b>（跟随系统 / 简体中文 / English）、<b>显示排版问题</b>、\n          <b>自动保存间隔</b>（0.5 / 1 / 2.5 / 5 / 10 秒）两端均可设置；网页版可开关<b>自动保存到浏览器</b>（草稿及全部标签内容，不写回原文件），桌面版可开关<b>自动保存到文件</b>与<b>保存时自动排版</b>。网页版的主题只在这里修改。\n          关掉「显示排版问题」后，状态栏右下角的「排版评分」徽标会隐藏，编辑时也不再运行排版检查\n          （长文档可省下每次输入的检查开销）；所有设置都会被记住。": "<b>Settings page</b>: click the gear at the top right (close with <code>Esc</code> or “Done”). It contains Appearance / Language / Editor: <b>theme</b> (light / dark), <b>interface language</b> (system / Simplified Chinese / English), and <b>show formatting issues</b>. The <b>autosave delay</b> (0.5 / 1 / 2.5 / 5 / 10 seconds) is configurable in both builds. On the web, toggle <b>autosave to browser</b> (drafts and all tabs; original files are not modified). On desktop, toggle <b>autosave to file</b> and <b>format on save</b>. In the web build, change the theme here only. Turning off formatting issues hides the score badge and stops checks while typing (saving work on long documents). All settings are remembered.",
