    "<code>Ctrl + F</code>：查找　<b>洛谷</b>；<code>Ctrl + H</code>：查找并替换　<span style=\"opacity:.7\">（本编辑器特有）</span>\n          <br /><span style=\"opacity:.7\">全部匹配会在编辑区<b>高亮</b>，当前匹配用深色标出。查找框内 <code>Enter</code> / <code>Shift+Enter</code> 跳下一个 / 上一个，替换框内 <code>Enter</code> 替换当前、<code>Ctrl+Enter</code> 全部替换，<code>Esc</code> 关闭；支持区分大小写、全词匹配、正则（<code>$1</code>～<code>$9</code> 引用分组）。<b>「全部」需点两次确认</b>（按钮会变红并显示处数，4 秒未确认自动取消）。替换可用 <code>Ctrl+Z</code> 撤销。</span>": "<code>Ctrl + F</code>: find　<b>Luogu</b>; <code>Ctrl + H</code>: find and replace　<span style=\"opacity:.7\">(unique to this editor)</span>\\n          <br /><span style=\"opacity:.7\">All matches are <b>highlighted</b> in the editor, with the current match marked in a darker colour. In the find box, <code>Enter</code> / <code>Shift+Enter</code> jump to the next / previous match; in the replace box, <code>Enter</code> replaces the current match and <code>Ctrl+Enter</code> replaces all; <code>Esc</code> closes it. Case sensitivity, whole-word matching and regular expressions (<code>$1</code>–<code>$9</code> group references) are supported. <b>“All” needs a second click to confirm</b> (the button turns red and shows how many matches were found; the confirmation is cancelled automatically after 4 seconds). Replacements can be undone with <code>Ctrl+Z</code>.</span>",
