    "➡️ :::align{right} 居右排版": "➡️ :::align{right} right-aligned block",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 1 条》明确要求：中文句末请使用全角句号 。 代替英文半角句号 .": "Rule 1 of the Luogu style guide requires a full-width full stop 。 at the end of a Chinese sentence instead of the half-width .",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 1 条》明确要求：特别地，句末要有【句号】。点击【洛谷排版修复】可自动补全句末句号。": "Rule 1 of the Luogu style guide requires, in particular, a full stop at the end of a sentence. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to add the missing full stops automatically.",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 1 条》明确要求：请使用全角中文标点符号（如用 句号 。 代替英文半角句号 .）。": "Rule 1 of the Luogu style guide requires full-width Chinese punctuation (use the full stop 。 instead of the half-width .).",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 1 条》明确要求：请正确使用【全角中文】标点符号（如 ，。！？：； 代替英文半角符号）。": "Rule 1 of the Luogu style guide requires correct <strong>full-width</strong> Chinese punctuation (use ，。！？：； instead of the half-width equivalents).",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 2 条》规定：非数学公式（一般英文单词、题目名、算法名、人名等）不应使用 LaTeX。应写为 {a} 而非 ${b}$。点击【洛谷排版修复】可一键自动去除 $ 符号。": "Rule 2 of the Luogu style guide: non-mathematical text (ordinary English words, problem titles, algorithm names, people’s names) should not use LaTeX. Write {a} instead of ${b}$. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to strip the $ signs in one click.",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 3 条》明确要求：中文标点符号与英文、数字或公式之间【严格严禁有空格】（如 `$n \\le 10^5$，` 正确，`$n \\le 10^5$ ，` 违规）。": "Rule 3 of the Luogu style guide: <strong>no space may ever appear</strong> between Chinese punctuation and English, digits or formulas (e.g. `$n \\le 10^5$，` is correct, `$n \\le 10^5$ ，` is a violation).",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 3 条》要求：中文与英文、数字或公式（即使包含粗体或斜体修饰，如 `中文 *and* 标点`）之间应以半角空格隔开。": "Rule 3 of the Luogu style guide: Chinese text and English, digits or formulas (even with bold or italic markup, such as `中文 *and* 标点`) must be separated by a half-width space.",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 3 条》要求：中文与英文、数字或公式（即使包含粗体或斜体修饰，如 “中文 *and* 标点”）之间应以半角空格隔开。": "Rule 3 of the Luogu style guide: Chinese text and English, digits or formulas (even with bold or italic markup, such as “中文 *and* 标点”) must be separated by a half-width space.",
    "《洛谷基本规范第 3 条》要求：中文汉字与英文单词、数字或 LaTeX 公式之间必须以半角空格隔开。": "Rule 3 of the Luogu style guide: Chinese characters and English words, digits or LaTeX formulas must be separated by a half-width space.",
    "《洛谷数学公式规范》要求公式中使用数学语言而非代码语言：<= 应写为 $\\le$，>= 应写为 $\\ge$，!= 应写为 $\\ne$，-> 应写为 $\\to$，<- 应写为 $\\gets$。点击【洛谷排版修复】可一键自动转换。": "The Luogu math rules require mathematical notation rather than code: write $\\le$ instead of <=, $\\ge$ instead of >=, $\\ne$ instead of !=, $\\to$ instead of -> and $\\gets$ instead of <-. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to convert them automatically.",
    "《洛谷数学公式规范》要求：乘号应使用 $\\times$ 或 $\\cdot$（如 $a \\times b$），严禁使用 * 代替乘号。点击【洛谷排版修复】可一键修复。": "The Luogu math rules require $\\times$ or $\\cdot$ for multiplication (e.g. $a \\times b$); using * instead is forbidden. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to repair it.",
    "《洛谷数学公式规范》要求：乘号应使用 $\\times$ 或 $\\cdot$，严禁使用 * 代替乘号。点击【洛谷排版修复】可一键修复。": "The Luogu math rules require $\\times$ or $\\cdot$ for multiplication; using * instead is forbidden. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to repair it.",
    "《洛谷数学公式规范》要求：同一个数学公式应写在同一个 LaTeX 环境内，严禁拆分成多个独立的 $ 包裹（如 $a$ + $b$ 应写为 $a + b$）。": "The Luogu math rules require one formula to stay inside a single LaTeX environment; splitting it into several separate $…$ fragments is forbidden (e.g. $a$ + $b$ should be $a + b$).",
    "《洛谷数学公式规范》要求：特定函数名应使用正体（如 $\\gcd, \\max, \\min, \\log, \\det$），未定义函数使用 $\\operatorname{lcm}, \\operatorname{dist}$，位运算使用 $\\operatorname{and}, \\operatorname{or}, \\operatorname{xor}$。点击【洛谷排版修复】可一键修复。": "The Luogu math rules require upright names for known functions (such as $\\gcd, \\max, \\min, \\log, \\det$), $\\operatorname{lcm}, \\operatorname{dist}$ for user-defined ones and $\\operatorname{and}, \\operatorname{or}, \\operatorname{xor}$ for bitwise operations. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to repair them.",
    "《洛谷题解规范》建议：中文一般不要放在 LaTeX 公式中（如 {a}）。公式仍会正常渲染。点击【洛谷排版修复】可自动包裹为 $\\\\text{中文}$。": "The Luogu solution rules advise against putting Chinese inside LaTeX formulas (e.g. {a}). The formula still renders fine. Click “Luogu formatting fix” to wrap it in $\\\\text{中文}$ automatically.",
    "《洛谷题解规范》明确禁止出现闲聊、吐槽、加戏、求赞、求管理员通过、「蒟蒻的第一篇题解」等内容，否则直接拒稿。": "The Luogu solution rules outright forbid small talk, complaints, drama, upvote begging, “please approve this” and “my first solution, I am a rookie” — they lead to rejection.",
    "《洛谷题解规范》要求代码块必须声明编程语言（如 ```cpp、```python），未指定时洛谷会默认按 C++ 高亮。": "The Luogu solution rules require a declared language on every code block (e.g. ```cpp, ```python); without one Luogu highlights it as C++ by default.",
    "「{a}」不是 Markdown 文档：预览会按 Markdown 规则渲染，保存时原样写回": "“{a}” is not a Markdown document: the preview renders it with Markdown rules and it is written back unchanged",
    "「{a}」已存在": "“{a}” already exists",
    "「{a}」有未保存的改动。不保存的话，这些改动会丢失。": "“{a}” has unsaved changes. If you do not save, they will be lost.",
    "「{a}」看起来不是文本文件。\\n\\n": "“{a}” does not look like a text file.\\n\\n",
    "「导出」→「打印 / 导出 PDF（NOI 风格）」，按官方 NOI 题面的观感排版：\n          全文衬线字体、样例框改为白底黑框、表格细黑线、标题去掉彩色与下划线。": "In the “Export” menu → “Print / Export PDF (NOI style)” the document is laid out like an official NOI problem statement:\\n          serif type throughout, sample boxes become black frames on white, tables use thin black rules, and headings lose their colour and underline.",
    "「导出」菜单 →「导出长图 PNG」，把整篇预览截成一张竖向长图，适合发论坛或聊天软件。": "“Export” menu → “Export tall PNG” turns the whole preview into one tall vertical image — handy for forums and chat apps.",
